OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud and
OL,6,Flight rain persisting at first this
OL,7,Fevening with rain gradually clearing
OL,8,Fto the north. Remaining cloudy
OL,9,Fovernight, which may be low enough to
OL,10,Fcreate some hill fog, with the
OL,11,Fpotential for the odd spot of drizzle.
OL,12,FStaying mild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FA drier day ahead although
OL,15,Fstill generally cloudy with the best
OL,16,Fof the brightness to the east. A brisk
OL,17,Fwesterly wind, feeling warm and humid,
OL,18,Fparticularly in any sunny breaks.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
